ASoC: sunxi: h713-msp: deep-review fixes for the bridge PCM (27.09.2026)

Input stream 2 by default (the one measured to reach DECODER3; 0 and 1 are silent), the
stall check counts STEP interrupts instead of comparing ring offsets (a ring size dividing
the check period read the same offset every time), prepare and START touch AUDBRG/AUDIF
only while the island is up and refuse a preparation older than the last island reset
(the S21 hang window), a sync_stop for the handlers, the range checks before the early
return, and the input-mute control only where the bridge PCM mixes. Findings B1, F1, F2,
F7, N1, N2 of umbau/work/_deepreview/audio. Applies after 0169.
